            <ArticleTitle>Case report: differential pressure impressions for complete dentures.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A method of producing a differential pressure, secondary impression of a lower arch with a sharp bony ridge is described. The use of this technique allows the clinician to dictate where the load is to be borne by the mucosa.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
